    "abstract": "Parts figure for the rudder trailing edge panel assembly, showing the plate and doubler group at the diverter strip terminations and the fastener set that goes with each standard.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the parts of the rudder trailing edge panel assembly, in particular the plate, doubler and fitting group at each lightning diverter strip termination.",
      "figure_note": "The figure shows one termination in detail and applies to all eight by repetition; the termination positions are given on the panel map rather than in the figure. The plate at item 10 carries the machined lug boss only at the extended strip standard, and the doubler at item 20 exists only at that standard. Ordering a post-modification plate without the doubler leaves the termination unsupported, so the two are catalogued as a set at item 10 on sheet 2."
    },
